msgid "Paykka Hosted"
msgstr "Paykka Hosted"

#: classes/wc-paykka-credit-card-gateway.php:37
#: classes/wc-paykka-credit-card-gateway.php:52
#: classes/wc-paykka-credit-card-gateway.php:333
#: includes/blocks/wc-gateway-paykka-support.php:17
msgid "Pay securely with the Paykka Hosted checkout"
msgstr "使用 Paykka Hosted 收银台安全支付"

#: classes/wc-paykka-credit-card-gateway.php:155
#: classes/wc-paykka-credit-card-gateway.php:194
#: classes/wc-paykka-credit-card-gateway.php:310
msgid "Connection settings"
msgstr "连接设置"

#: classes/wc-paykka-credit-card-gateway.php:156
msgid "Standard payments"
msgstr "标准支付"

#: classes/wc-paykka-credit-card-gateway.php:157
#: classes/wc-paykka-credit-card-gateway.php:269
msgid "Advanced settings"
msgstr "高级设置"

#: classes/wc-paykka-credit-card-gateway.php:203
msgid "Unchecked means production, checked means test. The environment can also be set in paykka-config.php (env) or with the PAYKKA_ENV constant in wp-config, both of which take precedence over this checkbox."
msgstr "未勾选为生产、勾选为测试。可通过 paykka-config.php（env）或 wp-config 常量 PAYKKA_ENV 选择环境，优先级高于本勾选。"

#: classes/wc-paykka-credit-card-gateway.php:220
msgid "Optional. Falls back to the Sandbox Merchant Id. Used in the v3 API request headers."
msgstr "可选，不填则使用 Sandbox Merchant Id。用于 v3 接口请求头。"

#: classes/wc-paykka-credit-card-gateway.php:242
msgid "Optional. Falls back to the Merchant Id. Used in the v3 API request headers."
msgstr "可选，不填则使用 Merchant Id。用于 v3 接口请求头。"

#: classes/wc-paykka-credit-card-gateway.php:250
msgid "API region"
msgstr "API 地区"

#: classes/wc-paykka-credit-card-gateway.php:255
msgid "Europe (https://openapi.eu.paykka.com)"
msgstr "欧洲地区 (https://openapi.eu.paykka.com)"

#: classes/wc-paykka-credit-card-gateway.php:256
msgid "Hong Kong (https://openapi.paykka.com)"
msgstr "香港地区 (https://openapi.paykka.com)"

#: classes/wc-paykka-credit-card-gateway.php:259
msgid "Region used for backend API calls in production. Europe and Hong Kong use different domains, so this must match the region of your Paykka account."
msgstr "生产环境下后端 API 调用使用的区域。欧洲与香港使用不同域名，请与 Paykka 账户所在区域一致。"

#: classes/wc-paykka-credit-card-gateway.php:274
msgid "Enable debug mode"
msgstr "开启 Debug 模式"

#: classes/wc-paykka-credit-card-gateway.php:279
msgid "Recommended while developing. Writes detailed entries to error_log (order placement, webhooks, signatures) to help troubleshooting. Turn it off in production."
msgstr "开发 Paykka 插件时建议勾选。将输出详细 error_log（下单、Webhook、签名等），便于排查。上线后请关闭。"

#: classes/wc-paykka-credit-card-gateway.php:282
msgid "Log request results"
msgstr "记录请求结果日志"

#: classes/wc-paykka-credit-card-gateway.php:287
msgid "When enabled, the URL, HTTP status code and response body of every Paykka API request are written to the PHP error_log. Make sure error_log output is configured on the server or in wp-config."
msgstr "开启后，每次 Paykka 接口请求的 URL、HTTP 状态码和响应体会写入 PHP error_log，便于排查。需在服务器或 wp-config 中配置 error_log 输出位置。"

#: classes/wc-paykka-credit-card-gateway.php:290
msgid "Authorise only"
msgstr "仅授权"

#: classes/wc-paykka-credit-card-gateway.php:295
msgid "PayKKa platform public key (webhook signature)"
msgstr "PayKKa 平台公钥（Webhook 验签）"

#: classes/wc-paykka-credit-card-gateway.php:299
msgid "When set, x-paykka-sign (SHA256_WITH_RSA) is enforced on /wp-json/paykka/v1/webhook. Leave it empty to skip verification (sandbox debugging only). The public key is available in the PayKKa developer documentation."
msgstr "填写后将对 /wp-json/paykka/v1/webhook 强制校验 x-paykka-sign（SHA256_WITH_RSA）。留空则跳过验签（仅建议沙箱调试）。公钥见 PayKKa 开放平台文档。"

#: classes/wc-paykka-credit-card-gateway.php:319
msgid "Enable Paykka payments"
msgstr "启用 Paykka 支付"

#: classes/wc-paykka-credit-card-gateway.php:327
msgid "Name of the Hosted payment method shown at checkout"
msgstr "结账时显示的 Hosted 支付方式名称"

#: classes/wc-paykka-credit-card-gateway.php:330
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: classes/wc-paykka-credit-card-gateway.php:380
msgid "Unable to start payment"
msgstr "无法发起支付"

#: classes/wc-paykka-credit-card-gateway.php:397
msgid "Payment request failed. Please try again or choose another payment method."
msgstr "支付请求失败，请重试或更换支付方式。"

#: classes/wc-paykka-credit-card-gateway.php:398
msgid "Payment request failed"
msgstr "支付请求失败"

#: classes/wc-paykka-credit-card-gateway.php:407
msgid "Payment session created but redirect URL is missing. Please contact support."
msgstr "支付会话已创建但缺少跳转地址，请联系客服。"

#: classes/wc-paykka-credit-card-gateway.php:408
msgid "Missing redirect URL"
msgstr "缺少跳转地址"

#: classes/wc-paykka-credit-card-gateway.php:423
msgid "Payment session failed"
msgstr "支付会话创建失败"

#: classes/wc-paykka-credit-card-gateway.php:444
#: classes/wc-paykka-credit-card-gateway.php:478
